      dct:description "Revised meeting note recording CTO Quinton Fairweather's decision to switch from Zypherion to Meridian for analytics, citing Zypherion's critical streaming ingestion gaps. Supersedes the prior Zypherion adoption decision. Q3 2026 migration window retained." ;
